{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================================
  Page « À propos » — Daewoo Security
  Section dédiée à /pages/a-propos. Ne rien réutiliser ailleurs sans adapter
  les textes : le contenu est spécifique à cette page.

  Conventions reprises du thème :
    - couleurs : navy #0b1e4a, bleu #1a4fab, cyan #48cae4 (parcimonieux)
    - typographies : polices du thème (settings.type_header_font / type_body_font)
      -> aucune requête de police supplémentaire, contrairement aux sections
         dws- de la page d'accueil qui chargent Google Fonts
    - rayons : 16 / 12 / 8 px
  Toutes les classes sont préfixées .dwsa- et portées par .dwsa pour éviter
  toute collision avec le CSS du thème.

  Images : réglables dans le personnalisateur (visuel hero, 3 photos Mérignac)
  et via les produits sélectionnés pour les 3 gammes.
  ============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign hero = section.settings.hero_image
  assign p_vigilia = section.settings.product_vigilia
  assign p_touch = section.settings.product_touch
  assign p_elite = section.settings.product_elite
  assign team_1 = section.settings.team_image_1
  assign team_2 = section.settings.team_image_2
  assign team_3 = section.settings.team_image_3
  assign logo_url = ''
  if settings.logo
    assign logo_url = settings.logo | image_url: width: 1056
  endif
-%}

<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
  --dwsa-navy: #0b1e4a; --dwsa-blue: #1a4fab; --dwsa-cyan: #48cae4; --dwsa-paper: #ffffff; --dwsa-mist: #f6f7fb; --dwsa-line: #e3e7f2; --dwsa-muted: #545e78; --dwsa-muted-soft: #7c85a0;
  --dwsa-display: {{ settings.type_header_font.family }}, {{ settings.type_header_font.fallback_families }};
  --dwsa-body: {{ settings.type_body_font.family }}, {{ settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }};
  --dwsa-r-lg: 16px; --dwsa-r-md: 12px; --dwsa-r-sm: 8px; --dwsa-gutter: 32px;
  }
  .dwsa, .dwsa *, .dwsa *::before,
  .dwsa *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .dwsa {
  font-family: var(--dwsa-body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--dwsa-navy); background: var(--dwsa-paper);
  }
  .dwsa img { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .dwsa p { margin: 0; }
  .dwsa a:focus-visible,
  .dwsa summary:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--dwsa-blue); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 4px;
  }
  /* ---------- Trame des sections ---------- */
  .dwsa-sec { padding: 96px var(--dwsa-gutter); }
  .dwsa-sec--mist { background: var(--dwsa-mist); }
  .dwsa-sec--navy {
  background: var(--dwsa-navy); color: #fff; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .dwsa-sec--navy::after {
  content: ""; position: absolute; top: -140px; right: -120px; width: 460px; height: 460px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(26,79,171,0.5) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none;
  }
  .dwsa-wrap {
  max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  .dwsa-wrap--narrow { max-width: 760px; }
  .dwsa-eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: var(--dwsa-body); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dwsa-blue);
  }
  .dwsa-eyebrow::before {
  content: ""; width: 18px; height: 1px; background: var(--dwsa-blue); flex: none;
  }
  .dwsa-sec--navy .dwsa-eyebrow { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }
  .dwsa-sec--navy .dwsa-eyebrow::before { background: var(--dwsa-cyan); }
  .dwsa h1, .dwsa h2,
  .dwsa h3 {
  font-family: var(--dwsa-display); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.12; text-wrap: balance; margin: 0; text-transform: none;
  }
  .dwsa h1 {
  font-size: clamp(46px, 7.4vw, 92px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .dwsa h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 42px); }
  .dwsa h3 { font-size: clamp(19px, 1.6vw, 22px); letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
  .dwsa-sec--navy h2 { color: #fff; }
  .dwsa-h1-sub {
  display: block; margin-top: 18px; font-size: clamp(19px, 2.1vw, 27px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--dwsa-blue);
  }
  .dwsa-lead {
  margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 20px); line-height: 1.65; color: var(--dwsa-muted); max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .dwsa-sec--navy .dwsa-lead { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
  .dwsa-body-txt {
  font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--dwsa-muted); max-width: 64ch;
  }
  .dwsa-note {
  font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--dwsa-muted-soft); max-width: 70ch;
  }
  .dwsa-sec--navy .dwsa-note { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.42); }
  /* ---------- Boutons et liens ---------- */
  .dwsa-btns { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .dwsa-btn {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 15px 28px; border-radius: var(--dwsa-r-sm); font-family: var(--dwsa-body); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.15s, background 0.15s;
  }
  .dwsa-btn--primary { background: var(--dwsa-navy); color: #fff; }
  .dwsa-btn--primary:hover { opacity: 0.88; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
  .dwsa-btn--ghost {
  background: transparent; color: var(--dwsa-navy); border: 1px solid rgba(11,30,74,0.2); font-weight: 600;
  }
  .dwsa-btn--ghost:hover { background: rgba(11,30,74,0.04); color: var(--dwsa-navy); text-decoration: none; }
  .dwsa-sec--navy .dwsa-btn--primary { background: #fff; color: var(--dwsa-navy); }
  .dwsa-sec--navy .dwsa-btn--primary:hover { color: var(--dwsa-navy); }
  .dwsa-sec--navy .dwsa-btn--ghost {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
  }
  .dwsa-sec--navy .dwsa-btn--ghost:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.14); color: #fff; }
  .dwsa-link {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-family: var(--dwsa-body); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dwsa-blue); text-decoration: none;
  }
  .dwsa-link::after { content: "\2192"; transition: transform 0.15s; }
  .dwsa-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .dwsa-link:hover::after { transform: translateX(3px); }
  /* ---------- 1 · Hero ---------- */
  .dwsa-hero { padding: 104px var(--dwsa-gutter) 0; text-align: center; }
  .dwsa-hero .dwsa-lead { margin-inline: auto; text-align: left; }
  .dwsa-hero .dwsa-btns { justify-content: center; }
  .dwsa-strip {
  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 10px 28px; margin-top: 44px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--dwsa-muted-soft);
  }
  .dwsa-strip span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .dwsa-strip span::before {
  content: ""; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--dwsa-blue); opacity: 0.5; flex: none;
  }
  .dwsa-hero-visual { max-width: 1160px; margin: 60px auto 0; }
  .dwsa-hero-visual img {
  width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 21 / 9; object-fit: cover; border-radius: var(--dwsa-r-lg);
  }
  /* ---------- 2 · Qui est Daewoo Security ---------- */
  .dwsa-who {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 28px; margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .dwsa-who-item { padding-top: 22px; border-top: 2px solid var(--dwsa-navy); }
  .dwsa-who-item h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .dwsa-who-item p {
  margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--dwsa-muted);
  }
  /* ---------- 3 · Repères ---------- */
  .dwsa-id {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1px; margin: 56px 0 0; background: var(--dwsa-line); border: 1px solid var(--dwsa-line); border-radius: var(--dwsa-r-lg); overflow: hidden;
  }
  .dwsa-id-cell { background: var(--dwsa-paper); padding: 26px 24px; }
  .dwsa-id-cell dt {
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dwsa-muted-soft);
  }
  .dwsa-id-cell dd {
  margin: 10px 0 0; font-family: var(--dwsa-display); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--dwsa-navy);
  }
  /* ---------- 4 · Solutions ---------- */
  .dwsa-sol {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .dwsa-card {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding: 30px 26px; background: var(--dwsa-paper); border: 1px solid var(--dwsa-line); border-radius: var(--dwsa-r-lg);
  }
  .dwsa-card p {
  flex: 1; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--dwsa-muted);
  }
  .dwsa-icon {
  width: 34px; height: 34px; stroke: var(--dwsa-blue); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  /* ---------- 5 · Gammes ---------- */
  .dwsa-ranges {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .dwsa-range {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--dwsa-paper); border: 1px solid var(--dwsa-line); border-radius: var(--dwsa-r-lg); overflow: hidden;
  }
  .dwsa-range img {
  width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; background: #fff;
  }
  .dwsa-range-body {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; flex: 1; padding: 28px 26px 30px;
  }
  .dwsa-range-body p { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--dwsa-muted); }
  .dwsa-spec {
  list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; flex: 1;
  }
  .dwsa-spec li {
  display: flex; gap: 10px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--dwsa-muted);
  }
  .dwsa-spec li::before {
  content: "\2713"; color: var(--dwsa-blue); font-weight: 700; flex: none;
  }
  .dwsa-legacy { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--dwsa-line); }
  /* ---------- 6 · Sans abonnement ---------- */
  .dwsa-noabo {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 56px; align-items: start; margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .dwsa-statement {
  font-family: var(--dwsa-display); font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 34px); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #fff; max-width: 26ch;
  }
  /* ---------- 7 · Daewoo Home Connect ---------- */
  .dwsa-subtitle {
  margin-top: 18px; color: var(--dwsa-blue); font-weight: 500;
  }
  .dwsa-chain { display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 14px; margin-top: 48px; }
  .dwsa-node {
  flex: 1; padding: 22px 22px 24px; background: var(--dwsa-paper); border: 1px solid var(--dwsa-line); border-radius: var(--dwsa-r-md);
  }
  .dwsa-node span {
  font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dwsa-muted-soft);
  }
  .dwsa-node strong {
  display: block; margin-top: 8px; font-family: var(--dwsa-display); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.015em; color: var(--dwsa-navy);
  }
  .dwsa-arrow { align-self: center; color: var(--dwsa-blue); font-size: 20px; flex: none; }
  .dwsa-stores { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .dwsa-store {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 11px 22px 11px 18px; background: var(--dwsa-navy); color: #fff; border-radius: var(--dwsa-r-sm); text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }
  .dwsa-store:hover { opacity: 0.88; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
  .dwsa-store svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; fill: #fff; flex: none; }
  .dwsa-store span { display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.2; }
  .dwsa-store small { font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
  .dwsa-store strong {
  font-family: var(--dwsa-display); font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  /* ---------- 8 · Chiffres ---------- */
  .dwsa-figure {
  display: block; font-family: var(--dwsa-display); font-size: clamp(64px, 11vw, 148px); font-weight: 800; line-height: 0.92; letter-spacing: -0.045em; color: #fff; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .dwsa-figure em { font-style: normal; color: var(--dwsa-cyan); }
  .dwsa-sec--navy .dwsa-figure + h2 {
  margin-top: 10px; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 30px);
  }
  .dwsa-stats {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .dwsa-stat { padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); }
  .dwsa-stat strong {
  display: block; font-family: var(--dwsa-display); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.015em; color: #fff;
  }
  .dwsa-stat p {
  margin-top: 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  }
  /* ---------- 9 · Équipe ---------- */
  .dwsa-team {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center; margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .dwsa-photos { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  .dwsa-photos img { border-radius: var(--dwsa-r-md); width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover; }
  .dwsa-photos > *:first-child { grid-column: span 2; }
  .dwsa-photos > *:first-child img { aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; }
  .dwsa-addr {
  margin-top: 28px; padding: 22px 24px; background: var(--dwsa-paper); border: 1px solid var(--dwsa-line); border-radius: var(--dwsa-r-md); font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--dwsa-muted); font-style: normal;
  }
  .dwsa-addr strong { color: var(--dwsa-navy); font-weight: 600; }
  .dwsa-addr a { color: var(--dwsa-blue); }
  .dwsa-inline { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 28px; margin-top: 28px; }
  /* ---------- 10 · Exploitation du site ---------- */
  .dwsa-sec--slim {
  padding: 36px var(--dwsa-gutter); border-top: 1px solid var(--dwsa-line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dwsa-line);
  }
  .dwsa-slim { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 40px; align-items: baseline; }
  .dwsa-sec--slim h2 {
  flex: none; font-family: var(--dwsa-body); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dwsa-muted-soft);
  }
  .dwsa-sec--slim p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--dwsa-muted); max-width: 76ch; }
  /* ---------- 11 · Où acheter ---------- */
  .dwsa-buy {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: start; margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .dwsa-buy--single { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 720px; }
  .dwsa-buy-main {
  padding: 34px; background: var(--dwsa-navy); color: #fff; border-radius: var(--dwsa-r-lg);
  }
  .dwsa-buy-main h3 { color: #fff; }
  .dwsa-buy-main p {
  margin-top: 14px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
  }
  .dwsa-buy-main .dwsa-link { margin-top: 20px; color: var(--dwsa-cyan); }
  .dwsa-buy-side {
  padding: 30px; background: var(--dwsa-paper); border: 1px solid var(--dwsa-line); border-radius: var(--dwsa-r-lg);
  }
  .dwsa-buy-side h3 { font-size: 15px; }
  .dwsa-buy-side p { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--dwsa-muted); }
  /* ---------- 12 · FAQ ---------- */
  .dwsa-faq { margin-top: 48px; border-top: 1px solid var(--dwsa-line); }
  .dwsa-faq details { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dwsa-line); }
  .dwsa-faq summary {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; padding: 24px 0; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; font-family: var(--dwsa-display); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.015em; color: var(--dwsa-navy);
  }
  .dwsa-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .dwsa-faq summary h3 {
  flex: 1; margin: 0; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; line-height: 1.35; color: inherit;
  }
  .dwsa-faq summary::after {
  content: "+"; flex: none; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--dwsa-blue);
  }
  .dwsa-faq details[open] summary::after { content: "\2212"; }
  .dwsa-answer {
  padding: 0 0 26px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--dwsa-muted); max-width: 72ch;
  }
  /* ---------- 13 · CTA final ---------- */
  .dwsa-cta { text-align: center; }
  .dwsa-cta h2 { max-width: 22ch; margin-inline: auto; }
  .dwsa-cta .dwsa-btns { justify-content: center; margin-top: 40px; }
  /* ---------- Tablette ---------- */
  @media screen and (max-width: 1000px) {
  .dwsa-sec { padding: 76px 28px; }
  .dwsa-hero { padding: 80px 28px 0; }
  .dwsa-sec--slim { padding: 32px 28px; }
  .dwsa-id, .dwsa-sol,
  .dwsa-ranges { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .dwsa-noabo, .dwsa-team,
  .dwsa-buy { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
  .dwsa-who { gap: 24px; }
  }
  /* ---------- Mobile ---------- */
  @media screen and (max-width: 680px) {
  .dwsa-sec { padding: 60px 20px; }
  .dwsa-hero { padding: 56px 20px 0; }
  .dwsa-sec--slim { padding: 28px 20px; }
  .dwsa h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 13vw, 60px); }
  .dwsa-h1-sub { font-size: 19px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .dwsa-who, .dwsa-id, .dwsa-sol, .dwsa-ranges, .dwsa-stats,
  .dwsa-photos { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .dwsa-photos > *:first-child { grid-column: auto; }
  .dwsa-photos > *:first-child img { aspect-ratio: 1; }
  .dwsa-chain { flex-direction: column; }
  .dwsa-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); align-self: flex-start; margin-left: 22px; }
  .dwsa-hero-visual img { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; }
  .dwsa-hero-visual { margin-top: 40px; }
  .dwsa-strip { gap: 8px 18px; font-size: 12px; }
  .dwsa-btns { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
  .dwsa-btn { justify-content: center; }
  .dwsa-statement { font-size: 24px; max-width: none; }
  .dwsa-figure { font-size: clamp(56px, 20vw, 84px); }
  .dwsa-faq summary { font-size: 16px; }
  .dwsa-slim { gap: 10px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .dwsa *, .dwsa *::before,
  .dwsa *::after { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
  }
</style>

<div class="dwsa">

  {%- comment -%} ============ 1 · Hero ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <header class="dwsa-sec dwsa-hero">
    <div class="dwsa-wrap dwsa-wrap--narrow">
      <h1>
        Daewoo Security
        <span class="dwsa-h1-sub">Alarmes et sécurité connectée sans abonnement</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="dwsa-lead">
        Daewoo Security propose des systèmes d’alarme, des caméras de surveillance et des
        équipements de sécurité connectée destinés à protéger maisons et appartements, sans
        abonnement de télésurveillance obligatoire. Le site Daewoo-Security.fr est exploité
        par Liz Invest SAS, société basée à Mérignac.
      </p>
      <div class="dwsa-btns">
        <a class="dwsa-btn dwsa-btn--primary" href="/pages/configurateur_2">Configurer mon alarme</a>
        <a class="dwsa-btn dwsa-btn--ghost" href="/pages/comparateur-vigilia-touch-elite">Comparer les systèmes Daewoo Security</a>
      </div>
      <div class="dwsa-strip">
        <span>Sans abonnement obligatoire</span>
        <span>Équipe à Mérignac</span>
        <span>Garantie 2 ans</span>
        <span>Application Daewoo Home Connect</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- if hero != blank -%}
      <div class="dwsa-hero-visual">
        {%- comment -%}
          Balise volontairement en majuscules : layout/theme.liquid applique
          `replace: "<img", "<img loading='lazy' "` à tout le contenu de page.
          Comme un attribut HTML dupliqué conserve sa première valeur, un
          loading="eager" serait annulé par l'injection. Le filtre replace de
          Liquid est sensible à la casse, donc <IMG ...> y échappe et garde sa
          priorité de chargement — c'est le visuel LCP de la page.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <IMG
          src="{{ hero | image_url: width: 1940 }}"
          srcset="{{ hero | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w,
                  {{ hero | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w,
                  {{ hero | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w,
                  {{ hero | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w,
                  {{ hero | image_url: width: 1940 }} 1940w"
          sizes="(min-width: 1224px) 1160px, calc(100vw - 64px)"
          width="{{ hero.width }}"
          height="{{ hero.height }}"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async"
          alt="Système d’alarme connecté Daewoo Security installé dans un logement">
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </header>

  {%- comment -%} ============ 2 · Qui est Daewoo Security ? ============ {%- endcomment -%}
